<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN GAS FIRM'S JAN-APRIL NET PROFIT 23.7 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN GAS FIRM'S JAN-APRIL NET PROFIT 23.7 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian Gas said on Wednesday that it had a 23.7 million litas net profit during the first four months of this year compared to 17 million litas in the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
